OL,3,GNEWSAPiccadilly line services halted   
OL,4,Afor 24-hour strike                     
OL,6,FThe Piccadilly line has closed as      
OL,7,Fcontrol staff stage a 24-hour strike.  
OL,9,FMembers of the Transport Salaried      
OL,10,FStaffs' Association (TSSA) working in  
OL,11,Fservice control walked out for 24 hours
OL,12,Fat midday on Friday in a dispute over  
OL,13,Fthe sacking of one of their colleagues.
OL,15,FTransport for London (TfL) said there  
OL,16,Fwould be no service on the line during 
OL,17,Fthe strike and that services would not 
OL,18,Freturn to normal until Saturday        
OL,19,Fevening. Some District line services   
OL,20,Fare also affected.                     
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
